  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-07-02T16:04:20.587Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It seems like the \"Item\" layer doesn't actually replace the \"reserved3\" layer: the \"reserved3\" layer actually moves on a different layer.\n\nThis happens to brand new projects and to projects that got updated from 3.8.1 to 3.8.2\n\nFirst image : My layers before the SDK update\n\nSecond image : My layers after the SDK update, notice that layer 23 is now \"reserved3\"",
